flowchart LR
  generators[Synthetic trace generators]
  balancer[Trace balancer collector]
  metrics[Trace count metrics]
  prometheus[Prometheus alerts]
  hub[MDAI Hub variables and rules]
  gateway[Gateway collector tail sampling]
  vendor[Trace destination]

  generators -->|OTLP traces| balancer
  balancer -->|load-balanced traces| gateway
  balancer -->|service trace counts| metrics
  metrics --> prometheus
  prometheus -->|firing and resolved alerts| hub
  hub -->|HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW volume service lists| gateway
  gateway -->|sampled traces| vendor
